{"title":"Design Your Own Rug!","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922419407/0/marginalrevolution~Design-Your-Own-Rug.html","date":1753874128000,"content":"<p>For my wedding anniversary, I designed and had hand-woven in Afghanistan a rug for my microbiologist wife. The rug mixes traditional Afghanistan designs with some scientific elements including Bunsen burners, test tubes, bacterial petri dishes and other elements.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/carpet1-768x1024.jpg\" width=\"560\" height=\"747\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/carpet1-768x1024.jpg 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/carpet1-225x300.jpg 225w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/carpet1-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/carpet1-1536x2048.jpg 1536w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/carpet1-260x348.jpg 260w\" /></p>\r\n<p>I started with several AI designs, such as that shown below, to give the weavers an idea of what I was looking for. Some of the AI elements were muddled and very complex and so we developed a blueprint over a few iterations. The blueprint was very accurate to the actual rug.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Afghan-1-585x1024.webp\" width=\"340\" height=\"595\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Afghan-1-585x1024.webp 585w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Afghan-1-171x300.webp 171w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Afghan-1-768x1344.webp 768w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Afghan-1-878x1536.webp 878w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Afghan-1.webp 1024w\" /></p>\r\n<p>I am very pleased with the final product. The wool is of high quality, deep and luxurious, and the design is exactly what I intended. My wife loves the rug and will hang it at her office. The price was very reasonable, under $1000. I also like that I employed weavers in a small village in Northern Afghanistan. The whole process took about 6 months.</p>\r\n<p>You can develop your own <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://afghanu.com/custom-handmade-rugs/\" target=\"_blank\">custom rug from Afghanu Rugs</a>. Tell them Alex sent you. Of course, they also have many beautiful <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://afghanu.com/\" target=\"_blank\">traditional designs</a>. You can even order <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://afghanu.com/product/4x5-lab-wall-rug-106cm-x-166cm-3ft-6in-x-5ft-5in/\" target=\"_blank\">my design</a> should you so desire!</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/design-your-own-rug.html\">Design Your Own Rug!</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/922419407/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/922419407/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/922419407/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f07%2fcarpet1-768x1024.jpg\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/922419407/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/922419407/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https: